{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "tools/a-tool-giving-one-answer-a-third-time-says-so",
  "title": "A tool that returns one answer a third time, for different arguments, has it noted for the model and on its row, and not for its observers",
  "rules": [
    "§6.4",
    "§9.3"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: channels/_ai_tools.py _model_part, _repeated_result_note; tests/test_repeated_result_note.py test_the_note_reaches_the_model_where_the_argument_guard_is_silent, test_the_note_counts_what_it_saw.",
